# annotation-of on a unit constructor with a @[...] annotation (T-1121).
# Unit constructors with @[...] annotations are wrapped in Value::Annotated at eval time.
# lower.rs emits CoreExpr::Variant wrapped in builtin-make-annotated
# annotation-of on the resulting Value::Annotated returns the annotation dict directly.
#
# MyType.Red → Value::Annotated{inner: Variant("MyType.Red", Null), annotation: {category: "primary"}}
# annotation-of MyType.Red → Dict({"category": "primary"})
#
# Type body wrapped in extra brackets [type [Red@[...]]] to force Dict body form in the type
# checker, avoiding "unknown parameterized type: Red" from the Annotated arm of resolve_type_expr.
[MyType: [type [Red@[category: "primary"]]]]
[ann: [annotation-of MyType.Red]]
[result: [= [get "category" ann] "primary"]]
=== out
Dict({"result": Bool(true)})
